      "value": "I just found out that generic avatars actually cannot use gesture-based animations at all, this is most likely happening since changes to avatar loading (2021.2.1, build 1088). This might be related to this bug, but is not exclusive to open beta: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/1088-generic-avatars-can-not-use-gesture-activated-animations-at-all",
