  "details": "As in the title.\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Be in 4pt or 6pt full-body tracking.\n2. Switch into a generic rigged avatar, it doesn't matter if it's SDK2 or SDK3.\n3. You will see your own avatar being below the floor, while others see you properly.\nAbove doesn't happen if you are in 3pt VR or in desktop mode.",
